      "projection": "From a generated manifest, retain run; files sorted by case_id/path with case_id, path, sha256, size_bytes, determinism, recipe, dicom, image, pixel_data, uids, expected_capabilities, expected_semantics, expected_visual_checks, known_stressors, profile_membership, references, validation status plus internal/standards check name and status, and standards_evidence; skipped_cases; and standards. Canonicalize by recursively sorting object keys and compact UTF-8 serialization with one trailing LF.",
